<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Stranger’s Sun</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">MELLOW DEAR US, Valkyrie, あんさんぶるスターズ！！</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">MELLOW DEAR US VS Valkyrie「Stranger’s Sun」あんさんぶるスターズ！！World Tour Series</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">5wSmCRSBozbTk5GwIdjTwc</ttm:item><itunes:duration>03:42.000</itunes:duration></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.790" end="00:16.170">一体いくつの魂が 産まれて消えた?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.170" end="00:17.920">名も無き侭</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.920" end="00:21.500">熱狂だけが火を灯した</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.500" end="00:23.400">歓声こそ人生さ</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.400" end="00:24.940">Everybody wants a dream</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.940" end="00:28.790">ああ 誰もが望むものだけが理想か?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.790" end="00:30.730">Nobody knows "the truth"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.730" end="00:32.370">So eyes show "the worth"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.370" end="00:36.130">官能は感情が混じり合う理由だ</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.130" end="00:37.930">Everybody wants a dream</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.930" end="00:39.520">That's the meaning of "our prime"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.520" end="00:41.020">Feel the stream in our music</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.490" end="00:41.990">共感という享楽が幸福なら</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.920" end="00:43.020">「告 創造こそ啓蒙と知るだろう</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.020" end="00:45.280">刻印する鳴動 幾星霜</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.280" end="00:46.780">磨こう 宝石足る希望」</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.780" end="00:48.920">道化としても構やしないさ</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.920" end="00:50.520">暗澹な異端の奇譚さえ</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.520" end="00:53.380">Playin' for grand show × 永遠の残照</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.380" end="00:57.010">This is the light this is the flame</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.010" end="01:00.680">Even if all are strangers sun is one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.680" end="01:04.280">This is our pride this is our beauty</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.280" end="01:08.530">Even if all are strangers sun is one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.530" end="01:10.030">そう</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.060" end="01:12.450">我が身が軈て朽ちて滅びようと</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.450" end="01:15.650">価値を求む者へ遺そう</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.650" end="01:17.150">This is the light this is the flame</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.880" end="01:17.380">Even if all are strangers sun is one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.340" end="01:19.810">今日を生きることの悦びを謳おう</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.810" end="01:22.690">輝きだけ 観せるべきさ</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.690" end="01:24.190">This is our pride this is our beauty</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.130" end="01:24.630">Even if all are strangers sun is one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.790" end="01:25.290">Stranger's sun</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.370" end="01:26.520">刮目せよ 絶え間なく燃ゆる太陽</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.520" end="01:28.290">誰も皆 望んでるよ</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.290" end="01:31.520">消えていく地上の炎を憐れむか?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.520" end="01:33.020">奏でる賛歌</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.230" end="01:36.060">眼差しは 瞬けば 劇しい光になる</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.060" end="01:39.480">感動の渇望の正体に出逢う</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.480" end="01:43.340">臆すことなく 己が意思を只紡いだ</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.340" end="01:46.800">芸術の徒 永劫を彩る</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.800" end="01:48.300">愛の価値は</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.070" end="01:50.630">一握りのものじゃないさ</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.630" end="01:54.010">見つめる瞳 熱を点そう</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.010" end="01:57.410">Feel the art in your live</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.410" end="02:00.290">双眸の位相 問う一生の意味を</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.290" end="02:01.790">I send vibes of lives to fill your life</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.610" end="02:02.110">That's the entertainment of creation</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.980" end="02:02.480">Revision of the future's vision</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.270" end="02:03.340">玲瓏たる楼閣の幻想も</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.340" end="02:05.010">狂躁こそ証明だよ</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.010" end="02:07.940">永遠の残照 × playin' for grand show</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.940" end="02:11.600">This is the prism this is the brightness</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.600" end="02:15.230">Even if all are strangers sun is one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.230" end="02:18.850">This is the rhythm this is the melody</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.850" end="02:23.060">Even if all are strangers sun is one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.060" end="02:26.990">今日を生きることの悦びを謳おう</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.990" end="02:30.190">輝きだけ 観せるべきさ</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.190" end="02:31.690">This is the prism this is the brightness</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.480" end="02:31.980">Even if all are strangers sun is one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.800" end="02:32.300">そう</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.850" end="02:34.270">我が身が軈て朽ちて滅びようと</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.270" end="02:37.150">価値を求む者へ遺そう</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.150" end="02:38.650">This is the rhythm this is the melody</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.450" end="02:38.950">Even if all are strangers sun is one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.750" end="02:39.250">Stranger's sun</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.100" end="02:41.560">歓喜の標を明日へと刻み込む</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.560" end="02:44.970">千年先へ宝石を届けよう</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.970" end="02:46.470">永遠なんて</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.330" end="02:48.840">今に価値を生みはしないさ</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.840" end="02:51.790">一瞬しかない生命を燃やせ</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.790" end="02:53.290">Believe your soul</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:52.540" end="02:55.520">後悔も 絶望も ここにはないのさ</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:55.520" end="02:57.020">Feel our music</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:56.500" end="02:59.260">貫けばいい 愛の証</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:59.260" end="03:01.620">太陽に照らされ乱反射する光</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:01.620" end="03:03.170">熱狂が歓声が創り出すよ快楽</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:03.170" end="03:07.920">永遠の残照 × playin' for grand show</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:07.920" end="03:11.560">This is the light this is the flame</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:11.560" end="03:15.220">Even if all are strangers sun is one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:15.220" end="03:18.830">This is our pride this is our beauty</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:18.830" end="03:23.070">Even if all are strangers sun is one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:23.070" end="03:24.570">そう</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:23.580" end="03:27.040">我が身が軈て朽ちて滅びようと</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:27.040" end="03:30.200">価値を求む者へ遺そう</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:30.200" end="03:31.700">This is the rhythm this is the melody</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:30.480" end="03:31.980">Even if all are strangers sun is one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:30.860" end="03:34.330">今日を生きることの悦びを謳おう</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:34.330" end="03:37.720">輝きだけ 観せるべきさ</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:37.720" end="03:39.220">This is the prism this is the brightness</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:37.990" end="03:39.490">Even if all are strangers sun is one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:38.250" end="03:42.250">Stranger's sun</p></div></body></tt>